    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm a college student and i take ritalin for my adhd but i have finals week coming up and i feel like it's just not hitting enough... i need to stay locked in. do u think it's okay if i drink like 3 or 4 monster energy drinks a day to help me focus better with my meds? or maybe just take some extra caffeine pills? i just need that extra edge to study",
